<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="">Dear {!IndividualApplication.COE_Approver__c},<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Following the review of the application titled <b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">“</b><b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">”</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">, the&nbsp;</span></font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">{!IndividualApplication.Account}&nbsp;</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">has requested </span><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">resubmission</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"> with
revisions&nbsp;</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif">from the {!IndividualApplication.COE_Name__c} </font><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</b><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">WIN-COE.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Please check comments below and ensure the revised application is prepared and submitted by {!IndividualApplication.Due_Date_for_Resubmission_WIN__c}.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Comments:</font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!IndividualApplication.WIN_Approval_Comments__c}.</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">Should you require any assistance during the resubmission
process, please don’t hesitate to reach out to&nbsp;win.support@wadhwanifoundation.org.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you for your cooperation and commitment to continuous
improvement.<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p>

